    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a42a04e176585fab5d235e24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难道您，从未觉得自己是\n特别的存在吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86059b0e29b9f52ee9a62bb59edb8e8c6545a952325aa65d4840bace132673b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1558f1375f0096cd1aaa396a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那一天，自己回答了『是』。\n那一瞬间，那静谧而炙热地震颤着的灵魂——",
      "source_fingerprint": "12cd5dfd93aac72db1dd150e19c3e17b2b9447828d39eb88b684d16bbd9fbf03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0996a50a1ffdee40f14cbdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再一次，紧紧相拥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3034a92dc55757549f1b22f8b135309c1f00d30e337e1f1d56e7184aa4a35c50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85271edf696e771cad97f2d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再次立下誓言吧。去探明『异世界』的真正含义，\n继续支持着致力于抵达那里的她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18cd2f7267fa4efd2c40a2f477eadc4d0fc32e0c639373696efea8c3ea5ebaf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6667515ba866aecbf522adab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（为了今后，绝不产生动摇——！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb7747e243d9e26a3d601faacf43530e6c73a0c5f691e2e1f6fb136e04ca39d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de46ec32591908a3bf750cb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "始终坚信\n圣女红色梦想，以及决定相信她的自己",
      "source_fingerprint": "af8ff71b215c0bc51a1f0bab979f985e072ff800d040c632a368a7ef1af8625f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1bedcb7172c84b42f53830f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136100.json",
      "json_path": [
